{"3753630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medieval Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3753630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Medieval Shop Simulator&quot;</strong> is a cozy first-person simulation where every aspect of running a medieval store comes to life — from stocking shelves with potions, herbs, and swords to selling them for coin and upgrading your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/e2c45b2541930c6a2b1b8fc23b67753e.avif?t=1761231803\" width=330 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and furnish thy humble shop</strong>, balancing both function and form. Choose where to lay thy wares, arrange thy aisles with care, and craft a welcoming space where townsfolk may browse with ease and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9224c3dd0c9bdf00d3558bc10b528f28.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9224c3dd0c9bdf00d3558bc10b528f28.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9224c3dd0c9bdf00d3558bc10b528f28.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/b3da25597e0cf1e7b834bc2cd1e29b9d.avif?t=1761231803\" width=245 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procure stock through thy trusty ledger or trade parchment</strong>. Unpack barrels and crates, store thy goods wisely in the backroom, and display them upon shelves, in cool cellars, or among iceboxes for those goods that perish quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/a29c2a8d352d87a4573322826cf04dff.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/a29c2a8d352d87a4573322826cf04dff.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/a29c2a8d352d87a4573322826cf04dff.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/bd3cec959442e8552e0d6960bae85234.avif?t=1761231803\" width=338 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tend the counter with diligence</strong>. Weigh items, tally sums, and accept payment in coin or noble promissory notes. Ensure each patron leaves with pouch lighter, heart glad, and arms full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/694a8aee90199d63cd844e88f3969a0f.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/694a8aee90199d63cd844e88f3969a0f.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/694a8aee90199d63cd844e88f3969a0f.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/0c2300953f5a2e9b0f9e27bddf59109b.avif?t=1761231803\" width=213 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reinvest thy hard-earned silver wisely</strong>. Expand thy shop’s walls, lay finer stone and timber, and ever adapt thy wares to match the needs of commoners, knights, and nobles alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9a6e88ac3348ac4759bf7dff09b28f5f.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9a6e88ac3348ac4759bf7dff09b28f5f.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9a6e88ac3348ac4759bf7dff09b28f5f.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/dc3781706b0af1c316e765ebeb203d77.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/dc3781706b0af1c316e765ebeb203d77.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/dc3781706b0af1c316e765ebeb203d77.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Medieval Shop Simulator</strong>, each choice thou makest weaveth thy path — from rustic stallkeeper to famed master of trade. Will thy name echo through the town square as the finest merchant of the realm?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Medieval Shop Simulator&quot;</strong> is a cozy first-person simulation where every aspect of running a medieval store comes to life — from stocking shelves with potions, herbs, and swords to selling them for coin and upgrading your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/e2c45b2541930c6a2b1b8fc23b67753e.avif?t=1761231803\" width=330 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design and furnish thy humble shop</strong>, balancing both function and form. Choose where to lay thy wares, arrange thy aisles with care, and craft a welcoming space where townsfolk may browse with ease and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9224c3dd0c9bdf00d3558bc10b528f28.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9224c3dd0c9bdf00d3558bc10b528f28.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9224c3dd0c9bdf00d3558bc10b528f28.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/b3da25597e0cf1e7b834bc2cd1e29b9d.avif?t=1761231803\" width=245 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procure stock through thy trusty ledger or trade parchment</strong>. Unpack barrels and crates, store thy goods wisely in the backroom, and display them upon shelves, in cool cellars, or among iceboxes for those goods that perish quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/a29c2a8d352d87a4573322826cf04dff.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/a29c2a8d352d87a4573322826cf04dff.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/a29c2a8d352d87a4573322826cf04dff.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/bd3cec959442e8552e0d6960bae85234.avif?t=1761231803\" width=338 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tend the counter with diligence</strong>. Weigh items, tally sums, and accept payment in coin or noble promissory notes. Ensure each patron leaves with pouch lighter, heart glad, and arms full.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/694a8aee90199d63cd844e88f3969a0f.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/694a8aee90199d63cd844e88f3969a0f.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/694a8aee90199d63cd844e88f3969a0f.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/0c2300953f5a2e9b0f9e27bddf59109b.avif?t=1761231803\" width=213 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reinvest thy hard-earned silver wisely</strong>. Expand thy shop’s walls, lay finer stone and timber, and ever adapt thy wares to match the needs of commoners, knights, and nobles alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9a6e88ac3348ac4759bf7dff09b28f5f.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9a6e88ac3348ac4759bf7dff09b28f5f.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/9a6e88ac3348ac4759bf7dff09b28f5f.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/dc3781706b0af1c316e765ebeb203d77.poster.avif?t=1761231803\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/dc3781706b0af1c316e765ebeb203d77.webm?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753630/extras/dc3781706b0af1c316e765ebeb203d77.mp4?t=1761231803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Medieval Shop Simulator</strong>, each choice thou makest weaveth thy path — from rustic stallkeeper to famed master of trade. Will thy name echo through the town square as the finest merchant of the realm?</p>", "short_description": "Run your own medieval shop! Stock shelves, set prices, serve customers, hire help, and expand your store. Trade with artisans by day — but when night falls, dark f